4f1d12dcaa, https://si.imgix.net/54077fdd/uploads/origins/7326201c-e1e2-4dff-8ac1-e9b369f00631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b294e04c0e8b4ac22e70d4883f3c9fb9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/54077fdd/uploads/origins/7326201c-e1e2-4dff-8ac1-e9b369f00631?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=370cdefbf03474b962a2f8c44b720d5a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、この度はアピールと依頼の機会をいただきありがとうございます！\nよりシンプルな蝶ネクタイのデザインでお願いできればと思いますが、ポーズや表情はおまかせします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1kuFmv12X9dF8C5PE9qNUoy0nEzRvXNIb", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eees_00/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7558d7b0/uploads/origins/f5e23eb2-d118-48be-94ea-6896add8540c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21ef00b9ee160d7634df1cf63154eeac", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7558d7b0/uploads/origins/f5e23eb2-d118-48be-94ea-6896add8540c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=21ef00b9ee160d7634df1cf63154eeac, https://si.imgix.net/7558d7b0/uploads/origins/f5e23eb2-d118-48be-94ea-6896add8540c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52d8eba5bfc26cd8f6cc572fe9b56af1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7558d7b0/uploads/origins/f5e23eb2-d118-48be-94ea-6896add8540c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c340c1c6222deee839b13949302ff35d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！描かれている人物の瞳が素敵だと感じました！\n是非イラストを描いていただきたいので、リクエストさせてください！\n\n■リクエスト内容\n私の推しのVtuberの湖国衣子さんのイラストを描いてください\nhttps://twitter.com/kokoku_ico/status/1605513934542278656\n\nゲーム配信をされる方なので、コントローラーを手に持って\nゲームしている雰囲気のイラストにしてください！\n\n■使用用途・提供データについて\n描いていただいたイラストは湖国衣子さんの活動に使用していただきたいと考えています。\nYouTubeのサムネイルやSNS投稿への活用を許可いただけると幸いです。\n※活動利用が大丈夫でしたら私の名前に🍀マークをつけてください！\n※背景の無いデータ（PNGもしくはレイヤー未統合のPSD）もご提供いただけると嬉しいです。\n\nリクエストを受けていただけたら幸いです！\n何卒よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/kokoku_ico/status/1605513934542278656", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eees_00/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0367b78b/uploads/origins/e096a2da-70a7-4b50-ba9f-2c09c287cd6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd6b05cee18f62acec2676f309b312fa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0367b78b/uploads/origins/e096a2da-70a7-4b50-ba9f-2c09c287cd6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd6b05cee18f62acec2676f309b312fa, https://si.imgix.net/0367b78b/uploads/origins/e096a2da-70a7-4b50-ba9f-2c09c287cd6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95d85cc4062fd00c6f0716a160fc98fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0367b78b/uploads/origins/e096a2da-70a7-4b50-ba9f-2c09c287cd6d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fb234a0a5b06d90f125f69e352009b5a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "hello!! can you please draw my vtuber hugging her two friends?? they are her cute mascots, she is their crime boss and they are her henchmen! she’s a mischievous girl who loves cars, guns, and heists! can you draw her hugging them with big smiles? maybe they could be holding some money and jewels they just stole? thank you so much!! \n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-1imGi1NjPD83eb4gSsNjViwtBBW0bWl\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-1imGi1NjPD83eb4gSsNjViwtBBW0bWl", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eees_00/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ecff8b65/uploads/origins/c6d0fa56-b267-43be-9ede-60a9e0514cd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39fd747567e0ea7c81ecec60d88cd1b9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ecff8b65/uploads/origins/c6d0fa56-b267-43be-9ede-60a9e0514cd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39fd747567e0ea7c81ecec60d88cd1b9, https://si.imgix.net/ecff8b65/uploads/origins/c6d0fa56-b267-43be-9ede-60a9e0514cd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f98c91a23d9c9a2caa555d3be362abe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ecff8b65/uploads/origins/c6d0fa56-b267-43be-9ede-60a9e0514cd0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de7be5542f52c60d036c1fdb1aceb1d6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "佐崎エス-sensei\n\nI really like the work you did in https://twitter.com/Ya29_i/status/1623983538151497729\n\nCan you please draw my character posing like she's taking a picture? The exact pose is up to you! (Hand reaching to the screen, the victory pose, or just waving, etc)\n\nI want to print out some transparent cards to take pictures of my character and the views, just like she is traveling with me.\n\n[Personality]\nShe is a tiger shark empress, she is cool and shy, but nice to other people, with 2 penguins as pets.\nShe has 2 moles, one under the left eye, and one under the right side of her mouth.\nShe is 167cm and C cup.\nShe has blue and orange nail polish.\n\nPlease design a casual outfit base on my character (her current design is meant to be live under the water).\n\n I would like the composition to be vertical; with the signature/character/background separated into different layers. Please don't crop the head of the character.\n\nThank you!\n\nAsakura Yukai\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GQe3coFU-tle0EwwnZyJDBWcz1UzBR8j", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@eees_00/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f19a0e93/uploads/origins/be4ae461-06ff-4e75-8864-102e0925388d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c607688704d0ad57f2a2a414e744ab1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f19a0e93/uploads/origins/be4ae461-06ff-4e75-8864-102e0925388d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c607688704d0ad57f2a2a414e744ab1, https://si.imgix.net/f19a0e93/uploads/origins/be